<title>USA: Electrostar Inc Q3 net income rises.</title>
<headline>Electrostar Inc Q3 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>LOGAN, Utah 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended		Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>		    Pro Forma*			 Pro Forma*</p>
<p>	   9/28/96  9/29/95 9/29/95     9/28/96  9/29/95 9/29/95</p>
<p> NET SALES    $18,071 $14,474 $14,474  $52,332 $44,213 $44,213</p>
<p> NET INCOME     1,898   1,102   1,621    5,753   2,857   4,400</p>
